        "export": "Hero",
        "kind": "package",
        "module": "@clossys/designer/blocks"
      },
      "license": "MIT",
      "notes": [
        "Header is a built-in SemanticContent intro keyed by the required heading, with eyebrow and description as supporting props; headingLevel permits h1.",
        "Backdrop accepts checked decorative static art, local assets.video declarations with resolved pause/resume labels, or a draft assets.backdrop runtime module declaration. Runtime art is resolved through the section host's explicit local module loader registry, after visibility and idle; reduced motion keeps the still, offscreen pauses, and load/runtime failure retains the poster. The hidden decorative layer owns no focusable controls; video pause/resume is outside it.",
        "Light and strong treatments retain the media-scrim gradient and four or five scalar scrim passes. All transfer sizes remain consumer declarations, not fetched or measured; module code, rights and consumer runtime adoption remain unmeasured.",
        "Source-only import and token-read measurements are lower bounds; shared anatomy, accessibility, contrast and consumer runtime conformance remain unmeasured. Content bindings describe host adaptation points, not type-equivalent converters."
